sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Candidate
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant P as OJCP Provider
    participant ATS as ATS

    C->>A: Apply to this role + resume

    A->>P: get_job_detail(job_id)
    P-->>A: JobPosting + apply_paths[]

    rect rgb(255, 248, 210)
        Note over C,A: Consent Gate
        A-->>C: Confirm application?
        C->>A: Confirmed
    end

    A->>P: begin_application(job_id, candidate, agent)
    P-->>A: status: pending_submission<br/>+ screening_questions[]

    Note over A,C: Agent fills screening answers<br/>from candidate context

    A->>P: submit_application(app_id, session_token,<br/>application_data{answers, resume_url})

    P->>ATS: POST application
    ATS-->>P: application_id

    P-->>A: status: submitted
    A-->>C: Application submitted ✓

    Note over P,ATS: If ats_direct or external_redirect:<br/>agent returns URL,<br/>candidate completes manually.
